2 CONT     * King Brychan Brycheiniog of Brycheiniog David Nash Ford's Early British Kingdoms
2 CONT     * St. Cynog David Nash Ford's Early British Kingdoms
2 CONT     * Gwynllyw Wikipedia
2 CONT     * Rhain Dremrudd, King of Brycheiniog David Nash Ford's Early British Kingdoms 
2 CONT
2 CONT Saint Bryan Ap AnnlachSaint Bryan Ap Annlach (b. 419, d. 450) Saint Bryan Ap Annlach (son of Anlach Mac Cormac and Marchell Ferch Tewdrig)1, 1 was born 419 in Brycheiniog, Breconshire, Wales1, 1, and died 450 in Y1, 1. He married 
2 CONC (2) Prawst Ferch Tudwal in Brycheiniog, Breconshire, Wales1. He married (3) Ribrawst Verch Vortigern. He married (4) Banhadlwedd Verch Banadl. He married (5) Rigrawst. He married (6) Roistri. He married (7) Anlach in Brycheiniog, 
2 CONC Breconshire, Wales1.
2 CONT
