2 CONC Chonóc (Cynog), Diraid, Dubán (Dyfnan), Cairinne (Caian), Cairpre, Iast, Ellóc (Dilic), Paan, Cáemán and Mo-Beóc, Breton sources[edit] Breton tradition says that Brychan married Menedoc daughter of Constantine, King of the Scots. 
