1 NOTE {geni:about_me} See Peter Bartrum, https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000173392255909 (February 6, 2023; Anne Brannen, curator)
2 CONT
2 CONT ID: I158039
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Gwynllyw ap GLYWYS
2 CONT
2 CONT Given Name: Gwynllyw ap
2 CONT
