2 CONC s dynasty being recorded, exactly which portion fell to Brydw is unknown. EBK suggests that he ruled Maelienydd (north-east Radnorshire) - which may have been named after his grandson, Mael ap Camuir - and possibly Elfael just to 
2 CONC the south. 
