2 CONT http://www.our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p4866.htm#i146110
2 CONT
2 CONT Gwawr ferch Brychan was born circa 510 at of Brycheiniog gwlad, Breconshire, Wales, England; She was illegitimate.1 She married Elidir "Lydanwyn" ap Meirchion "Gul", son of Meirchion "Gul" ap Gwrwst "Ledlwn", circa 535 at England.
2 CONC 1
2 CONT
