2 CONT
2 CONT Please see Darrell Wolcott: Constans I and His A.D. 343 Visit to Britain; http://www.ancientwalesstudies.org/id131.html. (Steven Ferry, April 5, 2017.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Please see Darrell Wolcott: Maxen Wledig and the Welsh Legends; http://www.ancientwalesstudies.org/id18.html (Steven Ferry, April 5, 2017.)
