2 CONT
2 CONT  Wife/Partner:         Dinoi of LIDININ
2 CONT
2 CONT  Child:         Gwrtheyrn Vortigern Vorteneu (High King) of BRITAIN
2 CONT
2 CONT _____	_____	_____	____	____	____	____	____	____	____	____	____	____	___	__	__	 
2 CONT
