2 CONT
2 CONT King of Scottish Dal Riada *Domongart (b. Abt. 472)
2 CONT
2 CONT King of Scottish Dal Riada *Domongart (son of *Fergus Mor macErcc, King of Scottish Dal Riada) was born Abt. 472. He married *Feldelm Foltchain, Queen of Scottish Dal Riada.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About King of Scottish Dal Riada *Domongart: Family History: Jerald L Chittenden (JerryC490@aol.com) at Ancestry.com.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of King of Scottish Dal Riada *Domongart and *Feldelm Foltchain, Queen of Scottish Dal Riada are: +*Gabran macDomongart, King of Dal Riada, b. Abt. 502, d. 560.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Notes for Gabran Mac Domgart: Gabran succeeded to the kingship upon his brother's death in 538. Welsh sources claim that he married a certain Luan (Lleian), daughter of Brychan the founder of the Welsh kingdom of Brycheiniog.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gabran's forces were defeated by the Picts in 558, He died later in the same year, and was succeeded by Comgall's son Conall. Gabran gave his name to the Cenel nGabrain, one of the four divisions of the Dalarida. Most of the kings
2 CONC  of Dalriada, and later of Scotland, were drawn from the Cenel nGabrain.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Gabran Mac Domgart are: i.+Aidan MacGabhran, b. 532, Argyll, Diaraita, d. 17 Apr 608, Scotland.
