2 CONC . Comgan, St, Oswin, St Kentigern and St. Elfleda].
2 CONT
2 CONT >'''Rhun ap Urien'''
2 CONT >FATHER: Urien "Rheged" ap Cynfarch "Oer", born about 0491 South Reged, Britain
2 CONT >MOTHER: Modron verch Afallach, born about 0497 Wales
2 CONT >SIBLINGS: a) Pasgen ap Urien born about 0529 Wales; b) Owain ap Urien
2 CONT >SPOUSE: unknown
2 CONT >CHILDREN: Rhoeth ap Rhun
