2 CONT Brochwel Ysgithrog, the king of Powys married Pabo’s daughter Arddun. A p  oem in the Book of Taliesin says that Taliesin was at the king’s court.
2 CONT
2 CONT             I sang before a famous lord, in the meadows of the Severn,
2 CONT                         Before Brochuael Powys, 
2 CONT
2 CONT Brochwell and Arddun’s son Tysilio founded churches in various parts of Wales including one on a tiny island in the Menai, on the opposite shore to Bangor. 
