2 CONT ----
2 CONT Has been portrayed as a ruthless, wicked ruler of impressive sinfulness. Man of culture, and many poets and musicians attend his court at Deganwyand. He entered a monastery, perhaps in an attempt to atone for previous sins. Died o
2 CONC f the yellow plague which originated in Egypt.
