2 CONT '''Maelgwn Gwynedd''' (died c. 547) was King of Gwynedd (reigned from ? – c. 547). ''More formally his name was'' '''Maelgwn''' ap Cadwallon (English: Maelgwn son of Cadwallon),'' also known as'' '''Maelgwn Hir''' (English: Maelgw
2 CONC n the Tall).
