2 CONT In the Mabinogion, Goleuddydd, the wife of Cilydd and mother of Culhwch, is said to be his daughter.  He was an historical person, but she was not. Her profile can be found here: https://www.geni.com/people/Goleuddydd-verch-Amlawd
2 CONC d-Fictitious-Mabinogion/6000000000351099314?through=6000000002577042648
