2 CONT ---------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Son or grandson of Constantine Corneu, fought as an ally of the Gododdin (the North Britons) at the battle of Catraeth (c. 598-600) against the Bernicians (Angles etc.), and may have been killed there. 
2 CONT *  http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Catraeth
2 CONT *  http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Y_Gododdin
2 CONT
2 CONT Easily confused with numerous other Geraints before and after his time.
