2 CONT    aka Eliudd; King of POWYS
2 CONT
2 CONT Born:  abt. 591    Died:  613     k. at Battle of Caer-Legion
2 CONT
2 CONT Poss. HM George I's 29-Great Grandfather.       Poss. Agnes Harris's 27-Great Grandfather.
