1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Antonius Donatus Gregorius''' (Welsh: '''Anwn Dynod'''), son of Maxientius, Western Roman Emperor and his partner Elen ferch Eudaf Hen. Halfbrother of Flavia Maxima Fausta and Aurelius Valerius.
