2 CONT Gwair (Gwyar) ap Dwywg Prince of Deheubarth-86286 [Parents] was born in 545 in Deheubarth, Gwynedd, Wales, Great Britain. He married Anna Mawgawse Pendragon Princess of Britain-86701 in , Gwynedd, Wales, Great Britain.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Mawgawse Pendragon Princess of Britain-86701 [Parents] was born in 525 in Tintagel Castle, Cornwall, England, Great Britain. She died in Gwynedd, Wales, Great Britain. She married Gwair (Gwyar) ap Dwywg Prince of Deheubarth-8
2 CONC 6286 in , Gwynedd, Wales, Great Britain.
