2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Brenin Powys Gwylog ap Beli o Powys was the successor of Brenin Powys Beli ab Eiludd o Powys; King of Powys.2 Brenin Powys Gwylog ap Beli o Powys was born circa 660.1 He was the son of Brenin Powys Beli ab Eiludd o Powys.1 King of
2 CONC  Powys at Wales circa 680.2 Brenin Powys Gwylog ap Beli o Powys was the predecessor of Brenin Powys Elisedd ap Gwylog o Powys; King of Powys.2
