1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Eudaf Hen (Eudaf "the Old") is a figure of Welsh tradition. He is remembered as a King of the Britons and the father of Elen Luyddog and Conan Meriadoc in sources such as the Welsh prose tale The Dream of Macsen an
2 CONC d Geoffrey of Monmouth's Latin chronicle Historia Regum Britanniae
2 CONT
2 CONT Erbin / Urban Gradlon MAWR (King) of BRITTANY aka Urban (Urbien Urbanus Gratian Gradlonus) `the Great'; aka Erbin ap CYNAN Meriadoc. Continue thru Conan MERIADOG ( King) of BRITTANY (& DOMNONIA) aka Conan (Cynan) Meriadoc ap GEREI
2 CONC NT
2 CONT
2 CONT Gradlon the Great aka ' Erbin Ap Cynan Meriadoc' aka 'Urban, Urbien, Urbanus' aka 'Gratian, Gradlonus' Mawr, King of Cornouaille, of Brittany
2 CONT
2 CONT dd mm 0434
