2 CONT ''''   Also called Cagintria Latin. Brenhines Brycheiniog Ceindrech verch Rhiwallon o Brycheiniog was born circa 630.1 She was the daughter of Brenin Brycheiniog Rhiwallon ab Idwallon o Brycheiniog.1 Brenhines Brycheiniog Ceindrec
2 CONC h verch Rhiwallon o Brycheiniog was the heiress of Brycheiniog circa 640.2 Heiress of Brycheiniog at the Brecon Beacons, Powys, Wales, between 640 and 650.2 She married Elisedd ap Ysgorda o Brycheiniog, son of Ysgorda Fychan ap Ys
2 CONC gorda o Brycheiniog and Nesta ferch Einion (?), circa 648; Her 1st. 4th cousins.1 Brenhines Brycheiniog Ceindrech verch Rhiwallon o Brycheiniog married Brenin Ddyfed a Brycheiniog Gwlyddien ap Nowy o Ddyfed, son of Brenin Ddyfed N
2 CONC owy I Hen ab Arthur o Ddyfed, before 650; Her 2nd. 7th cousins, 2x removed.1,3,4,2
