2 CONT    An AF record calls him King of the Britons.
2 CONT Idwal Iwrch was the King of Gwynedd 688.  He continued the fight against the Saxons.  Married Agatha and had a son, Rhodri Molwynog.  Other sources give his name variously as Edwal and Idwallo Ywrich ("the Roe").  He is cited as b
2 CONC eing the King of all Wales, 690.
