2 CONT
2 CONT      Æthelthryth (?) was the daughter of Anna, King of the East Angles. (1) She married Ecgfrið, King of Northumbria, son of Oswiu, King of Northumbria and Eanflæd (?), circa 667. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 679. (1)
