2 CONT      Edwin, King of Northumbria was born in 584. (2) He was the son of Ælle, King of Deira. (1) He married, firstly, Cwenburh (?). (2) He married, secondly, Æthelberg (?), daughter of Æðelbeorht I, King of Kent, in 625. (2) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 12 October 633. (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Edwin, King of Northumbria succeeded to the title of King Edwin of Northumbria in 616. (1)
2 CONT
