2 CONT The Historia Brittonum says that Æthelfrith gave the town of Din Guaire to his wife Bebba, after whom it was named Bamburgh;[17] Bede also says that Bamburgh was named after a former queen named Bebba, although he does not mention
2 CONC  Æthelfrith.[18] It has been suggested that she "was probably Æthelfrith's first and most important wife".[1]
