2 CONC fourth-generation descendant of the first Angles in England, the sources nevertheless record him as having been the first ruler of the Kingdom of Mercia. One explanation for this is that the Mercians had initially settled further 
2 CONC east and only moved into the area of what became known as Mercia in the time of Creoda.
2 CONT
