2 CONC heiniog.5 Brenin Ddyfed a Brycheiniog Cadwgn Trydelig ap Cathen o Ddyfed was the son of Brenin Ddyfed a Brycheiniog Cathen ap Gwlyddien o Ddyfed.1,2 King of Dyfed and Brycheiniog at South Wales circa 690.5 Brenin Ddyfed a Brychein
2 CONC iog Cadwgn Trydelig ap Cathen o Ddyfed was the predecessor of Brenin Ddyfed a Brycheiniog Rhain I ap Cadwgn Trydelig o Ddyfed; King of Dyfed. Brenin Ddyfed a Brycheiniog Cadwgn Trydelig ap Cathen o Ddyfed was the predecessor of Br
2 CONC enin Ddyfed a Brycheiniog Rhain I ap Cadwgn Trydelig o Ddyfed; King of Brycheiniog.5
