1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *Frithwold UnderKing of Surrey
2 CONT
2 CONT (end of information).
2 CONT
2 CONT father:
2 CONT
2 CONT unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT mother:
2 CONT
2 CONT unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT siblings:
2 CONT
2 CONT unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT spouse:
