1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bishop Cuthbert of Hereford (whose episcopate lasted from 736 to 740) is known to have placed a memeorial inscription on Mildfrith's tomb which refers to him as "sub-king" ("sub-regulus) and to have named his wife.
