2 CONT
2 CONT      Celemion verch Tudwal o Ynys Manau was born circa 720. She was the daughter of Brenin Ynys Manau Tudwal III ab Anarawd o Ynys Manau. Celemion verch Tudwal o Ynys Manau married Elidyr ap Sandde, Brenin Ynys Manau, son of Sandd
2 CONC e ab Alcun, before 750.1 As of before 750,her married name was of South Rheged.1
