2 CONT
2 CONT Sex: M 
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: ABT 784 1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: ABT 844 in Battle Of Cyfeil, Ketell, Wales 1
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Gwriad Ap Elidir Of Man King Of Gwynedd b: ABT 738 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Esyllt Verch Cynan Of Gwynedd b: ABT 770 in Caer Seiont, Carnarvonshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Nesta Verch Cadell b: ABT 780 in Powys, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT  Rhodri Mawr Ap Merfyn b: ABT 809 in Caer Seiont, Carnarvonshire, Wales
