2 CONT Queen of Wessex 672-674; Queen of Kent
2 CONT After the death of her husband King Edwin of Northumbria in 632, Sexburga went
2 CONT to Wessex where she married their king Kenwal. When Kenwal died in 672,
2 CONT Sexburga reigned as monarch for two years.
