2 CONT Died 17 November 375 (aged 54) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Place of death Brigetio on the Danube (near today Komárom, Hungary) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Predecessor Jovian 
2 CONT
2 CONT Successor Valens, Gratian and Valentinian II 
2 CONT
