2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT •ID: I092510 
2 CONT
2 CONT •Name: COLIUS II (NOTES)  (L) COLCHESTER 
2 CONT
2 CONT •Sex: M 
2 CONT
2 CONT •ALIA: COLE II (NOTES) (L) /COLCHESTER/ 
2 CONT
2 CONT •Birth: BET 202 AND 232 in WALES 
2 CONT
2 CONT •Death: BET 175 AND 262 1 2 
2 CONT
2 CONT •Event: 1 AKA COEL (NOTES) AP (L) CADVAN 
2 CONT
2 CONT •Event: 2 AKA COEL II (NOTES) (L) DE CAMULOD 
2 CONT
2 CONT •Event: 3 AKA COEL OR COULUS II (NOTES) KING OF (L) COLCHESTER 
2 CONT
2 CONT •Event: 4 AKA COEL GODHEBOG DECURION OF (L) COLCHESTER 
2 CONT
2 CONT •Event: 5 AKA COEL II (NOTES) OF (L) CAMULOD 
2 CONT
2 CONT •Note: 
2 CONT
2 CONT VARIOUS SOURCES CALL TWO DIFFERENT MEN "OLD KING COLE" 
2 CONT
2 CONT THEY WERE THIS ONE:
2 CONT
2 CONT COLIUS II (NOTES) "OLD KING COLE" (L) COLCHESTER BORN 202-232 (WHICH MAY BE WRONG FOR OTHER SOURCES SAY HE DIED IN 175-262).
2 CONT
2 CONT AND
2 CONT
2 CONT ANOTHER COLIUS "OLD KING COLE" (NOTES) (L) BRITAIN BORN BETWEEN 60 AND 125 IN COLCHESTER, ENGLAND (SHOWN AS THIS COLIUS'S GREAT GRANDFATHER HERE) 
2 CONT
2 CONT BOTH OF THESE MEN SUPPOOSEDLY HAD WIVES NAMED STRADA WHO IN TURN HAD MOTHERS NAMED GLADYS.
2 CONT
2 CONT THEY ARE SHOWN HERE AS TWO SEPARATE MEN FOR THEY LIVED SO FAR APART IN TIME EVEN THOUGH THERE SEEM TO MANY SIMILARITIES, THEY WERE APPARENTLY TWO DIFFERENT MEN.
2 CONT
2 CONT VARIOUS OTHER SOURCES DISAGREE AND SAY, FOR EXAMPLE, THAT THIS COLIUS II (NOTES) "OLD KING COLE" (L) COLCHESTER'S FATHER WAS MARIUS MERIC (NOTES) ARVIRAGUS (L) BRITAIN AND MOTHER WAS PENARDUN (NOTES) OF (L) BOUDICIA (WHO I SHOW HE
2 CONC RE AS THE OTHER KING COLE'S PARENTS). I SHOW IT HERE AS THE DATES AND THE PREPONDENCE OF EVIDENCE SEEM TO SUGGEST IS RIGHT BUT OBVIOUSLY I MAY BE WRONG.
2 CONT
2 CONT ALSO, SOME SOURCES SAY THIS COLIUS WAS THE FATHER OF ALTHILDIS (NOTES) PRINCESS OF (L) BRITAINS BUT HE IS NOT SHOWN SO HERE BECAUSE SHOWING MORE THAN ONE SET OF PARENTS COULD CAUSE MY "FAMILY TREE" PROGRAM TO MALFUNCTION.
2 CONT
2 CONT ALTHILDIS (NOTES) PRINCESS OF (L) BRITAINS IS SHOWN HERE AS THE DAUGHTER OF THE OTHER OLD KING COLE, COLIUS "OLD KING COLE" (NOTES) (L) BRITAIN
2 CONT
