2 CONT
2 CONT Erb was the son of King Meurig ap Caradog's son, Erbig. Nothing is known of his life, but he appears to have been the last King of a united Greater Gwent. It may have been during Erb's reign that King Cynan Garwyn of Powys invaded
2 CONC  Glywysing & Gwent after conquering Brycheiniog. However, the monks of Llancarfan managed to negotiate peace. After Erb's death in the mid-6th century, his Kingdom was divided between his young sons: Nynnio became King of Gwent & 
2 CONC Glywysing and Peibio, King of Ergyng.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
