1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Coenwulf (also spelled Cenwulf, Kenulf, or Kenwulph) was King of Mercia from December 796 until his death in 821. He was a descendant of a brother of King Penda, who had ruled Mercia in the middle of the 7th centur
2 CONC y. He succeeded Ecgfrith, the son of Offa.
