2 CONT    Young:L Merfyn, prince of Powys, died 904.
2 CONT    K: Merfyn, Prince of Powys.
2 CONT                        ******   Apparently his son, Llwellyn, lost the Kingdom of Powys to his uncle, Cadell. Llwellyn's daughter, Angharad, married Owain (Owen), son of Hywel the Good, to settle the claims of Llwellyn to the thro
2 CONC ne of Powys.  Says Mervyn Mawr died in 916.
2 CONT
