2 CONC  the broken coast turns around toward Mecklenburg, between Flensborg & Slesvik, north of Kiel Bay. They were close neighbors of the Swaefe to the SE (later the Swabians of medieval Germany) & of the Langobardi to the south (who la
2 CONC ter drifted to Italy & became known as the dreaded Lombards).
