2 CONT *3.         sister .  Her family origin and marriage are indicated by Olympiodorus Thebæus who records that Alaric was succeeded by “Adaulphum uxoris fratrem””[41].  m [https://www.geni.com/people/Alaric-the-Goth-king-of-the-Visig
