2 CONC don, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 168. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Families. 3.[S130] Wikipedia, online http;//www.wikipedia.org. Hereinafter cited as Wikipedia. 4.[S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Families, page 1
