1 NOTE 1  NAME Owain Ap Hywel /Dda/ 2  SOUR S033320 3  DATA 4  TEXT Date of Import: Jan 17, 2001 1  BIRT 2  DATE ABT. 922 2  SOUR S033320 3  DATA 4  TEXT Date of Import: Jan 17, 2001 1  DEAT 2  DATE 988 2  SOUR S033320 3  DATA 4  TEXT Da
