1 NOTE Ancestor (8 generations) to King Aidpud (ID=4899).
1 NOTE Attila the Hun, Scourge of God, Terrorizer and destroyer of Rome. Got as far as Orleans Gaul.
2 CONT Note: Doesn't belong in my family tree since he isn't related. Just have him here for historical reference.
1 NOTE 	1  NAME the Scourge of God //
