2 CONT Ailpín mac Eochaid 
2 CONT
2 CONT      Ailpín mac Eochaid was born in 778. He was the son of Eochaid IV 'the Poisonous', King of Dalraida and Fergusa (?).2 He died on 20 July 834 at Galloway, Scotland, killed fighting the Picts.2
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Ailpín mac Eochaid 1.Kenneth I 'the Hardy', King of Alba+ b. 810, d. 859 2.Donald I, King of Alba+ b. 812, d. 13 Apr 863 3.Grigair mac Ailpín1 b. c 820, d. 868
2 CONT
