2 CONT -------------------- Alpin of Kintyre, King of Scotland was the son of Eochaid IV 'the Poisonous', King of Dalraida and Fergusa (?). He died on 20 July 834 at Galloway, Scotland, killed fighting the Picts.
2 CONT
