2 CONT
2 CONT Flann Sinna, High King of Ireland (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #150118, d. 916
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=9 Jul 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT      Flann Sinna, High King of Ireland was the son of Máel Sechnaill I, High King of Ireland. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 916. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Flann Sinna, High King of Ireland was a member of the House of Clann Cholmáin. (1) He succeeded to the title of High King Flann Sinna of Ireland in 879. (1)
2 CONT
