2 CONT According to the manuscripts of Matthew Parker a 16th Century Archbishop of Canterbury, Aella was the son of Yffe, the son of Uxfrea, the son of Wilgisl, the son of Westerfalca, the son of Sæfugl, the son of Sæbald, the son of Seg
2 CONC egeat, the son of Swebdæg, the son of '''Sigegar''', the son of '''Wædæg''', the son of Woden
