2 CONT After Alfred's death in 899, Ealhswith became a nun. She died on 5 December 905, and is buried in St. Mary's Abbey, Winchester, Hampshire. <nowiki>--------------------</nowiki> After Alfred's death, she became a nun at St. Mary's 
2 CONC Abbey, Winchester around 901. She died on either 12/5 or 12/8 in 905. After her death, she was considered a saint by many people. <nowiki>--------------------</nowiki> Became a nun after her husband's death <nowiki>---------------
