2 CONT
2 CONT He was killed in 996 by Cynan ap Hywel, who then took Gwynedd -- later, his nephew, Idwal ab Eilsedd, would kill Cynan ap Hywel and take Gwynedd back.
2 CONT
2 CONT LDS sources give his spouse as Cecily verch Madog.
2 CONT
2 CONT Idwal ap Meurig, b. ca. 945 in Aberffroy, Malltraeth, Anglesey, Wales, d. 996 in Dindaethwy, Anglesey, Wales, cause of death was in battle near Penmynydd.
