2 CONT
2 CONT He was also known as Máel Coluim mac Domnaill.2 He succeeded to the title of King Malcolm I of Alba in 943.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Succeeded Constantine II. Killed in the Mearns (Grampians) by the people of Moray, whom he had forcibly subjugated on his accession in 943. Succeeded by Indulf.
