1 NOTE RESEARCH NOTES:
2 CONT King of England (899/900 - 924)
2 CONT Edward arguably exceeded Alfred's military achievements, restoring the Danelaw
2 CONT to Saxon rule and reigning in Mercia from 918, after the death of his sister,
2 CONT Ethelfleda. He spent his early reign fighting his cousin Aethelwald, son of
2 CONT Ethelred I. He had about eighteen children from his three marriages, and may
2 CONT have had an illegitimate child, too. He died in 924 and was buried at
2 CONT Winchester.
2 CONT Hvis det er riktig at Tyra was daughter of Edward, and ble gitt som "Danebot"
2 CONT til herjende vikinger under ledelse of Gorm (Guthrum?), kan she muligens ha
2 CONT vaert frilledatter. Det kjennes ingen kilder for hvem som was hennes mor.
