2 CONT
2 CONT Ælfthryth married Baldwin II (d. 918), Count of Flanders.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT Arnulf I of Flanders (c. 890-964), married Adela of Vermandois 
