2 CONT AELFTHRYTH Princess of England was born about 868 in Wessex, England. She died in 920. OR: ELFRIDA. In Giles' trans of William of Malmesb ury's 
2 CONT
2 CONT *Chronicles*, she is given as ETHELSWITHA: "He [Alfred] gave his daught er 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ethelswitha in marriage to Baldwin earl of Flanders, by whom he had Arnulf 
2 CONT
2 CONT and Ethelwulf." 
2 CONT
2 CONT --- William of Malmesbury, *Chronicle of the Kings of England *, c 1135, 
2 CONT
2 CONT tr John Allen Giles, London (Henry G Bohn) 1847, p 121 Parents: . Parents: West Saxon King Of Alfred ENGLAND and Queen Of Ethelswida ENGLAND.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Count Of Flanders Baudouin II II. Count Of Flanders Baudouin II II and Princess Of Elfthryth OF WESSEX were married after 893.20,81,112,114,115,116,119 Children were: Ct De Flanders\ Arnolph I Le Grand OF FLANDERS I, FLAND
2 CONC ERS, Adalolf Sur Mer De THEROUANNE, FLANDERS, FLANDERS.
