2 CONT Ælfthryth, Princess of Wessex (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #102629, d. 7 June 929
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=25 Feb 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT      Ælfthryth, Princess of Wessex was the daughter of Ælfræd, King of Wessex and Eahlwið, Princess of Mercia. (2) She married Baldwin II, Comte de Flandre, son of Baldwin I, Comte de Flandre and Judith, Princesse de France, betwe
2 CONC en 883 and 899. (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 7 June 929 at Flanders, Belgium. (3) She was buried at St. Peter's Abbey, Ghent, Belgium. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Ælfthryth, Princess of Wessex was also known as Ælftrud (?).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Ælfthryth, Princess of Wessex and Baldwin II, -Comte de Flandre
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Adelulf, Comte de Flandre d. 9333
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Arnulf 'the Great', Comte de Flandre+ b. bt 885 - 890, d. c 964
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source:
2 CONT
