2 CONT Ælfthryth of Wessex (died June 7, 929), also known as Elftrudis, was the last child of Alfred the Great, the Saxon King of England and his wife Ealhswith. She had four or five siblings, including King Edward the Elder and Ethelfle
2 CONC da.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ælfthryth married Baldwin II (died 918), Count of Flanders.
