2 CONT
2 CONT *Cadwgon ap Elystan
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 0975 Radnorshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT father:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Elystan "Glodrydd" ap Cuhelyn
2 CONT
2 CONT born 0933 Radnorshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT died Cefndigoll, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT buried Trelystan, Gorddwr, Montgomeryshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT mother:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Gwenllian verch Einion
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 0956 Dynevor, Llandyfeisant, Carmarthenshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT siblings:
2 CONT
2 CONT son ap Elystan born about 0977 Buellt, Breconshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT spouse (first):
2 CONT
2 CONT *Jane verch Brochwel
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 0970 Powys,Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT children (from first marriage):
2 CONT
2 CONT *Hoedlyw ap Cadwgon born about 1002 Radnorshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT died Talhoedlyw, Clun, Shropshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT spouse (2nd?):
2 CONT
2 CONT *Angharad verch Llawr
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 0992 Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT children (from 2nd marriage):
2 CONT
2 CONT *Ieuaf ap Cadwgon born about 1004 Radnorshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT *Idnerth ap Cadwgon born about 1017 Radnorshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT spouse (third?):
2 CONT
2 CONT *Efa verch Gwrgan
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 1020? Glamorgan, Wales
2 CONT
