2 CONT Eadgifu or Edgifu (Old English: Ēadgifu; 902 – after 955) was a daughter[1] of Edward the Elder, King of Wessex and England, and his second wife Ælfflæd (Æthelhelmsdottir). She was born in Wessex.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Charles 'the Simple' King of the Franks, 
2 CONT
2 CONT one son Louis d´Outremer IV of the Franks
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Herbert de Vermandois
2 CONT
