2 CONT
2 CONT      Eadgifu (?) was born in 902. She was the daughter of Eadweard I, King of Wessex and Ælflæd (?). (2) She married, firstly, Charles III, Roi de France, son of Louis II 'the Stammerer', Roi de France and Adelaide Judith (?), on 
2 CONC 7 October 919. (3), (4), (5) She married, secondly, Herbert III, Comte de Vermandois, son of Albert I, Comte de Vermandois and Gerberge de Lotharingie, circa 951 at Saint-Quentin, Aisne, France. (6) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died circa 953. (6)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Eadgifu (?) was also known as Ogiva (?). (2)
