2 CONT or 919
2 CONT
2 CONT     Marriage Information:
2 CONT
2 CONT Eadgifu also married Cte Herbert III DE VERMANDOIS, son of Comte Adelbert (Albert) I "The Pious" DE VERMANDOIS and Princess Gerberga CAROLING of Lorraine. (Cte Herbert III DE VERMANDOIS was born about 955 in Vermandois, Normandy, 
2 CONC France and died on 29 Aug 997.)
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eadgifu_of_Wessex
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Hedwig of Wessex
2 CONT
2 CONT This article is an outline about the Middle Ages and the Kingdom of France . You can share your knowledge by improving it ( how? ) as recommended by the corresponding projects . Hedwig of Wessex (born about 903 , died Sept. 26 aft
2 CONC er a 951 ) (Edgiva, Otgiva, Ottogeba, Warhead, Eadgifu of Kent, Edgifu). Anglo-Saxon princess and queen of the Frankish Carolingian dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography [ edit | edit the code ] Daughter of Edward the Elder , King of Wessex and England, and the noble Elfleda, she married the King of Western Francia Charles III in 919 . She gives him an heir, the future Louis IV .
2 CONT
2 CONT When her husband was captured and taken prisoner by the Count of Vermandois Herbert II in July 923 , Edwige fled with his father and is raising her son Louis in his own family, hence the name of Outremer .
2 CONT
2 CONT In 936 , she returned to Francie when his son recalled being crowned under the name of Louis IV of Outremer said. She then retired as a lay abbess at the Royal Abbey of Our Lady of Laon until 951 , the year in which she remarries 
2 CONC , ironically, with the Earl of Omois Herbert Old (910 / 926 - † 983/985), son of Herbert II of Vermandois, former jailer of her first husband.
2 CONT
2 CONT References [ edit | edit the code ] ↑ Edwige (Eadgifu of Kent) of Wessex on the website of the Foundation for Medieval Genealogy [archive] ↑ a , b and c François Neveux , The Adventure of the Normans.. eighth to the thirteenth cen
2 CONC tury, Paris, Perrin, coll "Tempus", 2009, 368 p ( ISBN 978-2-262-02981-4 ), p . 111 . ↑ Ottogeba regina mater Ludowici regis, egressa Lauduno, conducentibus is quibusdam tam quam herberti adalberti, fratris ipsius, hominibus ad He
2 CONC ribertum proficiscitur; which suscipiens eam, ducit in conjugem. Flodoard, Annals its 951, 132
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edwige_de_Wessex
