2 CONT      Eadgyth (?) was the daughter of Eadweard I, King of Wessex and Ælflæd (?). (2) She married Otto I von Sachsen, Holy Roman Emperor, son of Heinrich I von Sachsen, Holy Roman Emperor and Matilda of Ringelheim, between 925 and 9
2 CONC 30. (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 26 January 946 at Germany. (4), (1) She was buried at Cathedral of St. Maurice, Magdeburg, Germany. (3)
2 CONT
