2 CONT Born in 910, died in 946.
2 CONT Her Grandfather was Alfred of England and her ftaher was Edward, king of England. After the divorce of her parents 919 she moved into a convent in Salisbury.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married in 929AC at age 19 to Otto of Germany, who gave her the City of Magdeburg in morning gift. Otto was crowned kejser by the Pope in 946 just after her death. Buried in the Dom of Magdeburg, Germany. To be reburied in a coffi
2 CONC n of Titanium and Silver, designed by Kornelia Thümmel. Source: ritzau/dpa
