2 CONT Eadhilda (?) (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #105196, d. 26 January 947
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=8 Sep 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT      Eadhilda (?) was the daughter of Eadweard I, King of Wessex and Ælflæd (?). (1) She married Hugues of Neustria, Comte de Paris, son of Robert I, Roi de France, between 926 and 927. (2) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 26 January 947. (2)
2 CONT
