2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Ecgwyn was the mother of Athelstan, Alfred and St Edith - but NOT of the other profiles listed here - they are the children of Edward's other two wives, Elfleda and Edgiva. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Please help to correct this part of the tree if you can, Arthur Jackson.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Ecgwyn (?) (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #102440, d. circa 901
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=3 Dec 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT      Ecgwyn (?) married Eadweard I, King of Wessex, son of Ælfræd, King of Wessex and Eahlwið, Princess of Mercia. (2) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died circa 901. (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Ecgwyn (?) was also known as Egwina (?). (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Ecgwyn (?) and Eadweard I, King of Wessex
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Alfred (?) (3)
