1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Æthelstan or Athelstan was King of the Anglo-Saxons from 924 to 927 and King of the English from 927 to 939. He was the son of King Edward the Elder and his first wife, Ecgwynn. Modern historians regard him as the 
2 CONC first King of England and one of the greatest Anglo-Saxon kings. He never married and had no children. <br/>
2 CONT Athelstan died on 27 October 939, and his half-brother Edmund succeeded him as king.
2 CONT
