1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Eadgyth, daughter of Edward 'the Elder' and his first wife Ecgwynn. She married widower Sithric (Sigtrygg) of York who had three children from a previous marriage. 
2 CONT
2 CONT No children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLAND,%20AngloSaxon%20&%20Danish%20Kings.htm
