2 CONT Saint Edith (?) (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #102442, d. circa 927
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=14 Apr 2007
2 CONT
2 CONT      Saint Edith (?) was the daughter of Eadweard I, King of Wessex and Ecgwyn (?). She married Sihtric Caech, King of Northumbria on 30 January 926 at Tamworth, Gloucestershire, England. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died circa 927. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Saint Edith (?) was the Abbess in 927 at Tamworth Abbey, Gloucestershire, England. (1) She was a nun in 927 at Polesworth Abbey, Warwickshire, England. (1)
2 CONT
