1 OCCU  Prince of Deheubarth, King of Gwynedd and of Powys, aka Bledyn ap Kynuyan; Prince (Tywysog) of Deheubarth (of Powys); usurper of the throne of Wales; founder of the Third Royal Tribe of Wales. 
