2 CONT '''Máel Coluim mac Cináeda''', Malcolm II, King of Scots
2 CONT
2 CONT * Parents: Kenneth II and his wife the Lady of Leinster
2 CONT * Spouses: (name unknown - sometimes named as Ælfgifu "Edith" Sigurdsdóttir of Ossory)
2 CONT * Children:  
