1 NOTE BIOGRAPHY A Saxon ealdorman, Cerdic came to England with his son Cynric in 495 and founded a settlement on the coast of Hampshire. In 519 father and son fought the Britons at Charford, and from that year on Cerdic assumed the titl
2 CONC e of King of the West Saxons . He and his son conquered the Isle of Wight in about 534, the year that Cerdic died.
1 NOTE From THE RUFUS PARKS PEDIGREE by Brian J.L. Berry, pg 49, chart pg 45.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.     Cerdic, ... The Saxon royal heritage begins with Cerdic, a Saxon
2 CONT ealdorman who founded a settlement on the coast of Hampshire 495.  The
2 CONT Brythonic name suggests that he had a British mother.  He and his son Cynric
2 CONT brought five ships to a place afterwards called Cerdicesora, near modern
2 CONT Netley Marsh, Hants.  In 519 Cerdic assumed the title of King of the West
2 CONT Saxons and became the royal ancestor of the British line.  In 530 he and Cynric conquered the Isle of Wight.  He d. 534.  Two pedigree charts are attached showing the House of Cerdic and how it ultimately linked with the House of 
2 CONC Denmark.  The pedigree on the left is the genealogy of Cerdic, which should be regarded as legendary.  It was the one qualification of the early king of Wessex that they should be descended from Cerdic.  Otherwise fitness  to rule
2 CONC  was the only factor into consideration.  The strong kings were Ceawlin, Cedwalla, Ine and Egbert.  Cedwalla and Ine both abdicated their thrones to make pilgrimages to Rome.  the five kings (726-802) between Ine and Egbert were e
2 CONC clipsed by the kings of Mercia and Northumbria, but Egbert achieved lasting supremacy for Wessex, and was styled in a charter 'Rex Anglorum' (King of English).
2 CONT
2 CONT Availability: The libraries of Ken, Karen, Kristen, Kevin, Brian, Amie, Adam and
2 CONT FAL
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: LDS-FHC AFN:GTCF-8H  Birthdate, & Place
2 CONT
2 CONT Weis 1-1-1
1 NOTE No site Our Folk, traça-se uma curiosa genealogia que se confunde com a mitologia. A saber;
2 CONT Cerdic seria filho de Elesa que era filho de Esla que era filho de Gewis que era filho de Wig que era filho de Freawine que era filho de Frihogar, todos nascidos na antiga Saxônia, Alemanha. 
2 CONT Frihogar era filho de Brand da Escandinávia e este filho de Beldeg e Nanna Gewar (filha do Rei Gewar da Noruega). Beldeg era filho de ODIN (nascido em Asgard!!!! que estaria localizada na Ásia) e Frigg Frea (Frigga, segundo a Wiki
2 CONC pédia). A genealogia, nesse momento no ano 215 (nascimento de Odin) prossegue. Frigg era filha de Cadwalladr e Odin, filho de Fredalaf Frithuwald e Beltza. Fredelaf era filho de Freothelauf que era filho de Finn que era filho de F
2 CONC locwald que era filho de Godwulf que era filho de Geata que era filho de Tecti que era filho de Beowa que era filho de Scealdea.  A última data registrada foi o nascimento de Flocwald por volta do ano 100 e todos os locais registr
2 CONC ados de Odin até Flocwald são Asgard (na ásia ou leste europeu). 
