2 CONT Hugh the Great (898-16 June 956) was duke of the Franks and count of Paris, son of King Robert I of France and nephew of King Odo. He was born in Paris, Ile-de-France, France. His eldest son was Hugh Capet who became King of Franc
2 CONC e in 987. His family is known as the Robertians.
2 CONT
