2 CONT
2 CONT King Edgar I
2 CONT
2 CONT AKA Edgar the Peaceful
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: c. 942 AD
2 CONT
2 CONT Birthplace: Wessex, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Died: 8-Jul-975 AD
2 CONT
2 CONT Location of death: Winchester, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Cause of death: unspecified
2 CONT
2 CONT Remains: Buried, Glastonbury Abbey
2 CONT
