2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Adele of Vermandois (bef. 915–960) was both a Carolingian as well as a Robertian Frankish noblewoman who was the Countess of Flanders (934–960).
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents  [hide]  1	Life 2	Ancestry 3	See also 4	Notes 5	References Life[edit] Adele, born c. 910–915[1] was a daughter of Herbert II of Vermandois and his wife, Adele, daughter of Robert I of France.[2] She died in 960 in Bruges.
2 CONC [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT In 934 Adele married Count Arnulf I of Flanders (c. 890 – 965).[3] Together they had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Hildegarde,[a] born c. 934, died 990; she married Dirk II, Count of Holland.[4] Liutgard, born in 935, died in 962; married Wichmann IV, Count of Hamaland.[3] Egbert, died 953.[3] Baldwin III of Flanders.[3] (c. 940 – 962). Marrie
2 CONC d Mathilde Billung of Saxony (c. 940 - 1008), daughter of Hermann Billung, and had issue, Arnulf II, Count of Flanders (c. 960 – 987), who succeeded as count after Arnulf I, skipping one generation. Elftrude; married Siegfried, Co
2 CONC unt of Guînes.[3] Ancestry[edit] [show]Ancestors of Adele of Vermandois See also[edit] 	Belgium portal Counts of Flanders family tree Notes[edit] Jump up ^ It remains uncertain if Hildegarde was Arnulf's daughter by his first wife
2 CONC , whose name was not preserved, or by his second wife Adele. See: Heather J. Tanner, Families, Friends and Allies: Boulogne and Politics in Northern France and England, C.879-1160 (Brill, Leiden, Netherlands, 2004) p. 55 n. 143
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Born in 910 Deceased 10 October 958 - Brugge, West-Vlaanderen, België , age at death: 48 years old Buried - Sint-Pietersabdij, Gent, Vlaanderen, België
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents Herbert Ii de Vermandois de Vermandois, Graaf 880-943 Adela de Neustrie, Prinses 887-931/
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses and children Married in 934 to Arnulf I De Grote van Vlaanderen, Graaf Count 885..890-965 with M Odo I van Vlaanderen F Elftrude van Vlaanderen 935- F Hildegard van Vlaanderen, Gravin ca 936-990 M Egbert van Vlaanderen 937
2 CONC -953 F Luitgard van Vlaanderen ca 941-964 M Boudewijn Iii van Vlaanderen, Graaf Van Vlaanderen Count Of Flanders 944-962
2 CONT
