2 CONT
2 CONT Elstrude married Cte Sifrid (Siegfried) "le Danois" (the Dane) DE GUОNES, son of Godefroy DE DANOIS and Prncess Gisela DE LORRAINE. (Cte Sifrid (Siegfried) "le Danois" (the Dane) DE GUОNES was born in 935 in Guisnes, Flanders, Bel
2 CONC gium and died in 970 in Guisnes, Flanders, Belgium.)
2 CONT
