2 CONT
2 CONT Elstrude married Count Of Guisnes Sigfried LE BLOUNT, son of Count Of Flanders Arnulf Le Blount DE FLANDERS and Alice DE VERMANDOIS. (Count Of Guisnes Sigfried LE BLOUNT was born in 925 and died in 965.)
2 CONT --------------------
