1 NOTE 110913632. Grev Balduin III ARNULFSØN av Flandern was born about 940. (10251) He was a Greve in 958 in Flandern. (10252) He died on 1 Nov 962.(10253) He was married to Matilda BILLUNG in 961.
1 NOTE _P_CCINFO 1-20792
2 CONT Original individual @P2689282772@ (@MS_NHFETTERLYFAMIL0@) merged with @P2689282889@ (@MS_NHFETTERLYFAMIL0@)
