1 NOTE Alias:<ALIA> Count de Flanders and /Artois/
2 CONT Baudouin III, Count de Flandre  (Stuart, Royalty for Commoners, Page 102, 
2 CONT Line 141-35.) AKA: 
2 CONT Baudouin, Comte d'Artois. Born: circa 940, son of Arnoul I, 
2 CONT Count de Flandre and Adele=Alix de Vermandois . Note - before 
2 CONT 961 in Flandre, Belgium: Baudouin III was the co-Comte de 
2 CONT Flandre [with his father, whom he predeceased]. Married in 961: 
2 CONT Mahaut=Mathilda de Saxe, daughter of Hermann, Duke de Saxe and 
2 CONT Hildegarde von Westerburg. Died: on 1 Nov 962 Baudouin III died 
2 CONT before his father and reigned jointly with him, leaving his son, 
2 CONT Arnoul II as infant heir. Arnoul I sought the aid of King 
2 CONT Lothaire, offering Artois, Ostrevant, Ponthieu and Amiens in 
2 CONT exchange for his support.
1 NOTE Greve av Flandern fra 958 til 960.
