2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT  Nesta Verch Rhys b: ABT 1080 in Dynevor Castle, Carmarthenshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT  Margared Verch Rhys b: ABT 1082 in Wales
