2 CONT CADWGAN ap Bleddyn (-1111).  Prince of Powys.  Lord of Nannau.  He was ancestor of the family of Lloyd of Blaenglyn, see Burke's Landed Gentry.  m (1098) GWENLLIAN of Gwynedd, illegitimate daughter of GRUFFYDD ap Cynan King of Gwy
2 CONC nnedd & his mistress --- ([1080]-).  
