2 CONT
2 CONT Alain was Prince of Cornouaille in Brittany, France. He was the successor of Budig Castellin, Prince of Cornouaille; Prince of Cornouaille, his grandfather.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alain died in 1026 at the age of 51.
