1 NOTE 1  BIRT 2  DATE ABT. 1057 2  PLAC Of Tegaingl 2  SOUR S033320 3  DATA 4  TEXT Date of Import: Jan 17, 2001 1  BIRT 2  DATE ABT. 1065
