2 CONT
2 CONT    2. ^ Ann Williams, "Leofric" in M. Lapidge (ed.), The Blackwell Encyclopedia of Anglo-Saxon England. Oxford: Blackwell, 1999. ISBN 0-631-22492-0
2 CONT
2 CONT    3. ^ a b The Anglo-Saxon Chronicle
2 CONT
2 CONT    4. ^ The Anglo-Saxon Chronicle ed. M. Swanton (1996), p. 294.
2 CONT
