2 CONT Sir Guy de Warwick de Ardenne
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Lived in Northumberland, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Leofwine (c. 950 – 1028) was an ealdorman of the Hwicce in Mercia. He is mentioned as Wicciarum Prouinciarum dux[1] Ealdorman of Hwicce in 997.
2 CONT
2 CONT The chronicles mention four children of Leofwine, their order of birth is unknown:
2 CONT
