2 CONT
2 CONT    4. ^ Higham, pp. 6–7; Stafford, Unification, pp. 52–53.
2 CONT
2 CONT    5. ^ Higham, pp. 6–7; Miller, "Edgar"; Stafford, "Ælfthryth".
2 CONT
2 CONT    6. ^ Miller, "Edgar"; Stafford, "Ælfthryth".
2 CONT
2 CONT    7. ^ Higham, pp. 7–14; Stafford, Unification, pp. 57–59.
2 CONT
2 CONT    8. ^ Higham, pp. 7–14; Stafford, "Ælfthryth"; Stafford, Unification, pp. 57–59.
2 CONT
2 CONT    9. ^ Stafford, "Ælfthryth"
