2 CONT
2 CONT Wulfthryth (?) (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #161322
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=8 Sep 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT      Wulfthryth (?) married Eadgar 'the Peaceful', King of England, son of Eadmund I, King of England and Ælfgifu (?). (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Wulfthryth (?) and Eadgar 'the Peaceful', King of England
