1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dirk II Count in Frisia Reign	928/944 – 988 Predecessor	Dirk I Successor	Arnulf Born	920/930 Died	6 May 988 Egmond, West Friesland, Duchy of Lower Lorraine Burial	Egmond, West Friesland, Duchy of Lower Lorraine Spo
