2 CONT * [830] When she gave birth to her husband's posthumous child.  
2 CONT * [831] Historia Comitum Ghisnensium 11, MGH SS XXIV, p. 568.  
2 CONT * [832] Historia Comitum Ghisnensium 11, MGH SS XXIV, p. 568.  
2 CONT * [833] Chronica Monasterii Sancti Bertini auctore Iohanne Longo de Ipra 27.2, MGH SS XXV, p. 776.  
2 CONT * [834] Historia Comitum Ghisnensium 12, MGH SS XXIV, p. 568.  
2 CONT * [835] Liber traditionum sancti Petri Blandiniensis, 96, p. 92.  
2 CONT * [836] Historia Comitum Ghisnensium 14, MGH SS XXIV, p. 569.  
