1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''NOTE:''' ''As of [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/NORTHERN%20FRANCE.htm#_Toc43878012 '''September 2022, Medlands'''] does not support this profile belonging to presently linked parentage.''
