1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * '''FYI: As of 20 Sep 2022, Medlands does ''not'' indicate any wife or children of Arnulf II:''' 
2 CONT * "2. ARNOUL [I] de Boulogne ([920/25] – after 31 Jan 972). "''Arnulfus nepos ipsius comitis [Arnulfi]''" is named in the Cartulaire de Saint-Bertin[430].  It is unlikely that he was born much before [920/25] considering the estim
2 CONC ated birth date of his father.  Lothaire IV King of the West Franks installed him as Comte de Boulogne et du Ternois[431]. "…''Arnulfi Bononiensis comitis, Engelberti advocati''…" signed the charter dated 31 Jan 972 under which "'
2 CONC 'Arnulfus…marchysus" confirmed the possession of "Harnas…in pago Seirbiu''" to Saint-Pierre de Gand[432]."
2 CONT
2 CONT Death place given as Kent, England and Guisnes, Picardie, France. No sources.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Married 0978 - Guisness, France
