1 NOTE Nesta was firstly mistress to Henry I; secondly she married Stephen,Constable of Cardigan; thirdly she married Gerald of Windsor. Gerald andNesta had four children:
2 CONT 1. William fitzGerald.
2 CONT 2. Maurice fitzGerald.
2 CONT 3. David fitzGerald.
2 CONT 4. Angarat, a daughter.
2 CONT Known as the most beautiful woman in Wales. She had many lovers.
2 CONT In Christmas 1108 Owain ap Cadwgan of Cardigan came to visit Gerald andNesta. He so lusted after her that he, that night, attacked the castleand carried
2 CONT her off and had his way with her. This upset Henry I so much that theincident
2 CONT started a war.
