2 CONT While you are here have a look at her husband's ancestry. Its quite impressive.
1 NOTE OR "GODIVA"; (PREPORTED TO BE THE "LADY GODIVA" OF HISTORY); A SAXON
1 NOTE 30th great grandmother
2 CONT The Famous Lady Godiva that roda naked on her horse through Coventry.
1 NOTE BIOGRAPHY: Lady Godiva: aka Godgifu, wife of Leofric, Earl of Mercia. Flourished in the 11th Century. Legendary Lady who rode naked through the streets of Coventry to win from her husband relief for the people of Coventry from his
2 CONC  burdensome taxation. She built and endowed monasteries at Stow and Coventry.
2 CONT
2 CONT  -- Webster's Biographical Dictionary
