2 CONT     Nelson, 86.
2 CONT     Nelson, 86. There has been confusion in the past regarding Bernard's wife's identity. He had only one wife and Nest was not his second wife but rather his mother-in-law.
2 CONT     Nelson, 87.
2 CONT     Nelson, 81.
2 CONT     Nelson, 88.
2 CONT     Nelson, 89.
2 CONT     Nelson, 82.
2 CONT     Nelson, 90 and n25.
