1 OCCU Duque da Bretanha e conde da Cornualha, Comte, de Nantes, Prince, de Cornouailles, Duc consort, de Bretagne, Count of Cornouilee, Jure uxoris Duke of Brittany, Comte de Cornouaille, Duke of Brittany, Count of Cornouaille, count of
