2 CONC oluim-meic-Cin%C3%A1eda-Princess-of-Scots/6000000001061869741?through=6000000001744982887 Donada] of Scotland ([1005]-killed in battle Lumphanan 15 Aug 1057, bur Isle of Iona).  He succeeded in 1040 as MACBETH King of Scotland.  G
2 CONC ruoch & her [first husband] had [one child]: 
