2 CONT '''Donnchad mac Crínáin (Modern Gaelic: Donnchadh mac Crìonain) anglicised as Duncan I,  (died 14 August 1040) was king of Scotland (Alba).''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Crínán 'the Thane', Mormaer of Atholl and Bethóc of Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife: [http://www.geni.com/people/Suthen-Sibylla-of-Scotland/6000000000424732452?through=6000000005037689063#   Suthen also called Sibylla] (NB: NOT Siward's daughter but his cousin, read her About) Children:
2 CONT
