2 CONC ng Malcolm III Canmore.
1 NOTE Elämänkerrallisia tietojaDuncan I    Malcolm III, b.  c.1031, d.  Nov.  13, 1093, founded the house of Canmore, which ruled Scotland for more than 200 years, and consolidated the power of the Scottish monarchy.  He was the son of 
2 CONC Duncan I, who in 1040 was killed by MACBETH.  Malcolm lived in exile until 1057, when he defeated and killed Macbeth near Lumphanan in Aberdeenshire.  He succeeded to the throne in 1058 after the death of Lulach, Macbeth's stepson
2 CONC .
