2 CONT of disastrous wars and internal strife, was ended in 1040 with his
2 CONT assassination by Macbeth, his successor and cousin. SeeMacbeth.murdered by Macbeth.From KINGS & QUEENS OF SCOTLAND By AlanBold ..by adding Strathclyde to his grandfather's kingdom, firstmonarch of a united Scotland. Duncan's marri
