2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Family: A Complete Genealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 23. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Family.
2 CONT
2 CONT    2. [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Family, page 178.
2 CONT
2 CONT    3. [S125] Richard Glanville-Brown, online <e-mail address>, Richard Glanville-Brown (RR 2, Milton, Ontario, Canada), downloaded 17 August 2005.
2 CONT
2 CONT    4. [S8] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 106th edition, 2 volumes (Crans, Switzerland: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 1999), volume 1, page 13. Hereinafter cited as Burke's Peerage and Baroneta
2 CONC ge, 106th edition.
2 CONT
2 CONT    5. [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Family, page 179.
2 CONT
