2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT MALDRED, son of CRINAN "the Thane" Mormaer of Atholl [Scotland] & his wife Bethoc of Scotland Lady of Atholl (-killed in battle [1045]). He is named son of Crinan by Roger of Hoveden[379]. Lord of Allerdale. Regent of Strathclyde 
2 CONC 1034/35.
2 CONT
2 CONT m ([before 1040]) EALDGYTH [Ælfgifu], daughter and heiress of UHTRED Earl of Northumbria & his third wife Ælfgifu of England (1016 or before-). Simeon of Durham names "Algiva daughter of earl Uchtred [and] of Algiva daughter of ki
2 CONC ng Agelred" when recording that her father arranged her marriage to "Maldred the son of Crinan"[380], although her father was long since dead when she married. Named daughter of Uhtred and Elgiva by Roger of Hoveden, who also name
2 CONC s her husband and his father[381].
2 CONT
2 CONT Lord Maldred & his wife had four children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. GOSPATRICK ([1040/48]-[1075]). Simeon of Durham names "Cospatric son of Maldred son of Crinan" when recording that he was appointed Earl of Northumberland[382]. Earl of Northumberland from Dec 1067.
2 CONT
2 CONT - see below.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. MALDRED . The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identified. m ---. The name of Maldred´s wife is not known. Maldred & his wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT a) UHTRED . The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identified. m ---. The name of Uhtred´s wife is not known. Uhtred & his wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) [383]DOLFIN . The Prior of Durham granted him Staindrop (in which Raby is a township) in 1131[384]. m ---. The name of Dolfin´s wife is not known. Dolfin & his wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT (a) [385]MALDRED . m ---. The name of Maldred´s wife is not known. Maldred & his wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT (1) [386]ROBERT FitzMaldred (-[25 Jun 1242/26 May 1248]). Lord of Raby and Brancepeth, co. Durham. m as her first husband, ISABEL de Neville, daughter of GEOFFREY de Neville & his wife Emma de Bulmer (-before May 1254). She was he
2 CONC iress of her brother Henry de Neville. She married secondly Gilbert de Brakenberg. Robert & his wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT a. GEOFFREY FitzRobert (-1242). He assumed the name Neville after his mother's family.
2 CONT
2 CONT - see ENGLISH NOBILITY. EARLS of WESTMORELAND (NEVILLE).
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) [GOSPATRICK . "…Cospatric filius Uctred…" witnessed inquisitions by "David…Cumbrensis regionis princeps", dated 1124, concerning land owned by the church of Glasgow[387].]
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. daughter.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. daughter.
