1 CONC itain. According to Welsh sources, his wife was Lleian, daughter of Brychan, the ruler who gave his name to Brecknock. [Ancestral Roots, line 170-4]
1 CONT     Note: AR doesn't follow the Welsh, as AR says that Gabran is son of Domongart.
