1 CONT Meirchion the Lean, presumably a very slim man, was the son of Gwrast Lledlwm. He succeeded his father as King of a united Rheged, though he lost Elmet to his younger brother, Mascuid. Upon Meirchion's death in about AD 535, the K
1 CONC ingdom was divided between his two sons, Cynfarch Oer and Elidyr Llydanwyn. 
1 CONT
