0 @N6000000003051119772@ NOTE [Wikipedia, "Beli ap Rhun", retrieved 22 Dec 07]
1 CONT Beli ap Rhun (c. 517-599, reigned from c. 586) was king of Gwynedd. Very little is known about his reign, which suggests he ruled relatively unremarkably during a time of comparative peace and stability. He was succeeded by his so
1 CONC n Iago.
