0 @N6000000003949663130@ NOTE King of Brycheiniog & King of Dyfed.  It was during his reign that the Welsh Annals record "the hammering of the region of Dyfed" which probably refers to an onslaught by Artglys of Ceredigion.  (EC11 "Kings and Queens of England"
1 CONC  by Mike Ashley
