0 @N6000000002188314130@ NOTE Æthelric of Bernicia
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Aethelric was the fourth known king of the Kingdom of Bernicia which he ruled from 568 to 572. Aethelric was the father of Æthelfrith, who was the first monarch to rule both Bernicia and Deira, the two constituent parts of what ca
1 CONC me to be considered Northumbria.
1 CONT
1 CONT Aethelric was one of the sons born to Ida of Bernicia, founder of the kingdom. Nothing is known for certain of Aethelric's life and reign. The earliest authorities differ widely on the order and the regnal years of the kings betwe
1 CONC en the death of Ida and the beginning of Æthelfrith's rule in 592/593.
0 @N6000000000437032844@ NOTE Name Suffix:<NSFX> King Of Bernicia
