1 CONT     * R.L.S. Bruce-Mitford, Aspects of Anglo-Saxon Archæology: Sutton Hoo and other discoveries (London 1974).
1 CONT     * R.L.S. Bruce-Mitford, The Sutton Hoo Ship-Burial (Vol I) (London 1975).
1 CONT     * J. Campbell, The Impact of the Sutton Hoo Discovery, in The Anglo-Saxon State (Hambledon & London, London, 2000). ISBN 1-85285-176-7
1 CONT     * D. Dumville, 1976, The Anglian Collection of royal genealogies and regnal lists, Anglo-Saxon England 5, 23-50.
1 CONT     * N.J. Higham, Rædwald, in M. Lapidge et al (eds), The Blackwell Encyclopedia of Anglo-Saxon England (Blackwell, London 1999). ISBN 0-631-22492-0
1 CONT     * D.P. Kirby, The Earliest English Kings (london 1991).
1 CONT     * S. Newton, The origins of Beowulf and the Pre-Viking Kingdom of East Anglia (Cambridge 1993).
1 CONT     * S. Newton, The Reckoning of King Rædwald (Brightlingsea 2003).
1 CONT     * S. Plunkett, Suffolk in Anglo-Saxon Times (Tempus 2005).
1 CONT     * F.M. Stenton, 1959, The East Anglian Kings in the seventh century, in P. Clemoes (ed.), The Anglo-Saxons: Studies presented to Bruce Dickens (London 1959).
1 CONT     * B. Yorke, Kings and kingdoms of early Anglo-Saxon England (London 1990).
1 CONT
