1 CONT
1 CONT Tytila (died c. 593) was the King of East Anglia from about 578 until his death, and the father of Raedwald of East Anglia.
1 CONT
1 CONT His name is the Anglo-Saxon form of the Gothic Totila.
1 CONT
1 CONT
