1 CONT     * Ashely, Mike The Mammoth Book of British Kings & Queens New York: Carroll & Graff 1998 ISBN 0-7967-0692-9
1 CONT     * Bede, Continuatio, years 732, 735, 766, and Epistola ad Ecgberctum
1 CONT     * Fryde, E. B.; Greenway, D. E.; Porter, S.; Roy, I. (1996). Handbook of British Chronology, Third Edition, revised, Cambridge: Cambridge University Press. ISBN 0-521-56350-X. 
1 CONT     * Haddan and Stubbs, Councils and Ecclesiastical Documents, Oxford, 1869–1878, iii. 403-431
1 CONT     * Hindley, Geoffrey A Brief History of the Anglo-Saxons: The beginnings of the English nation New York: Carroll & Graf Publishers 2006 ISBN 978-0-78671738-5
1 CONT     * Mayr-Harting, Henry (1991). The Coming of Christianity to Anglo-Saxon England. University Park, PA: Pennsylvania State University Press. ISBN 0-271-00769-9. 
1 CONT     * Mayr-Harting, Henry "Ecgberht (d. 766)" Oxford Dictionary of National Biography Oxford University Press, 2004 Online Edition accessed November 9, 2007
1 CONT     * Proceedings of Surtees Society, Durham, 1853.
1 CONT     * Stenton, F. M. Anglo-Saxon England Third Edition Oxford:Oxford University Press 1971 ISBN 978-0-19-280139-5
1 CONT
