1 CONT  Howell was born in around 880, the younger son of Cadell ap Rhodri, himself the son of Rhodri the Great.  
1 CONT  Howell was able to consolidate his position by marrying Elen, whose father had ruled Dyfed until his death.  
1 CONT  Howell's reign, uncharacteristically for the time, was a peaceful one, and he achieved an understanding with Athelstan of England. 
