0 @N6000000003658762207@ NOTE AEDDAN, first Lord of Grosmont Castle, Monmouthshire. At a battle fought at the beginning of the XII century he gained possession of North Wales and Denbarth; and being afterwards converted to Christianity, reigned over them in pe
1 CONC ace and wisdom for fifteen years.
