1 CONT Acceded to the throne in 871 at death of his last surviving brother during one of their battles with the invading Danes. He is the only English king (Canute was Danish) to have been designated "the Great" He is known by some as Ki
1 CONC ng of England, but is more properly designated as King of Wessex.[Geoffrey De Normandie, Gedcom BSJTK Smith Family Tree.ged]
