1 CONT One of the outstanding figures in English history, Alfred's laws were the
1 CONT first that made no distinction between the English and the Welsh peoples.
1 CONT He was the only ruler to resist Danish invasions successfully and laid
1 CONT the foundation for the unification of England.One of the outstanding figures in English history, Alfred's laws were the
1 CONT first that made no distinction between the English and the Welsh peoples.
