0 @N6000000003949656241@ NOTE Eldest child of Alfred the Great.  Often signed charters jointly with Athelred.  Bef. 900 took administration due to illness of husband.  Continued her husbands campaign against the Welsh.  Led the defense against the Vikings.  Fo
1 CONC rtified Chester.  Sought to salvage Saxon relics from destruction by the Vikings.  
1 CONT She was considered on the great warrior queens of England 
