0 @N6000000003300525748@ NOTE KENNETH II (r. 971-95)
1 CONT Kenneth was the brother of Dubh. In 973 he acknowledged King Edgar of Eng land as his lord in return for recognition that the Scots now held Lothia n, which they had seized from the Angles. In about 994, however, he brok e his pro
1 CONC mise to keep the peace and invaded England. He was defeated, an d lost Lothian again. He killed Culen's brother in 977 and was himself ki lled in 995 in a blood feud at Fettercairn, Kincardineshire by Culen's so n, Constantine.
0 @N6000000003494734490@ NOTE [Eldad_Grannis.FTW]
