1 CONC rincess of Mercia|d. 5 Dec 905|p10261.htm#i102607|Ethelhelm (?) , Ealdorman||p10306.htm#i103054|Elswitha (?)||p10662.htm#i106614|');"Pedigree <JavaScript:pup('Edhilda (?)|d. 26 Jan 947|p10520.htm> Last Edited=10 May 2003
1 CONT Edhilda (?) was the daughter of Edward 'the Elder', King of Wessex <p10244.htm> and Elfleda (?) <p10245.htm>. She married Hugues of Neustria, Comte de Paris <p10519.htm>, son of Robert I, Roi de France <p10519.htm>, between 926 an
1 CONC d 927.1 She died on 26 January 947.1
1 CONT Child of Edhilda (?) and Hugues of Neustria, Comte de Paris <p10519.htm>:
1 CONT Hugues de Paris, Roi de France <p10311.htm>+ b. c 938, d. 24 Aug 996
1 CONT Citations
1 CONT [S11 <s1.htm>] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Family: A Complete Genealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 13. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Family.
