0 @N6000000003635705009@ NOTE [3010] BIRTH: Anglo-Saxon England, Frank Stenton p 360
1 CONT COMYN4.TAF (Compuserve Roots), p. 5
1 CONT BAOSE.TAF (Compuserve)
1 CONT EDWARD3.DOC 923
