1 CONC ance of his family by marrying Aelfthryth, daughter of Alfred the Great. On his death in 918 [sic] his possessions were divided between his two sons Arnulf the Elder and Adalulf, but the latter survived only a short time and Arnul
1 CONC f succeeded to the whole inheritance." {-Encyclopaedia Britannica, 1956 Edition, 9:356} (source: Albert E. Meyers database, aem@ezonline.com, http://www.ezonline.com/aem/aem.html)
