1 CONT
1 CONT In his southern expansion Arnulf inevitably had conflict with the Normans, who were trying to secure their northern frontier. This led to the 943 murder of the Duke of Normandy, William Longsword, at the handsof Arnulf's men.
1 CONT
1 CONT The Viking threat was receding during the later years of Arnulf's life, and he turned his attentions to the reform of the Flemish government.
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit] Family
1 CONT In 934 he married Adele of Vermandois, daughter of Herbert II of Vermandois. Their children were:
