1 CONT information about the  marriage of Rollo, the Scandinavian, with Gisela,
1 CONT daughter of King Charles  the Simple.'
1 CONT This is from Dudo, and I've seen it copied in some modern books. It is,
1 CONT however, chronologically impossible, since Gisela at the time of the
1 CONT marriage in 911 would have been at the most four years old.
1 CONT Reference: Eckel,  Charles le Simple , p. 80, and Brandenburg,  Die
1 CONT Nachkommen Karls des Grossen , p. 118. //
