0 @N6000000003178011312@ NOTE Italy: HISTORY: Italy, 962-1300: ITALY UNDER THE SAXON EMPERORS: TheOt tonian system.  In the midst of these favourable signs, the Italianpol itical landscape offered little ground for optimism. The only hope for stability and eve
