1 CONC g, Otto I (936-97 3), sonof Henry the Fowler, to her aid. Although much involved in affa irs inGermany, he came to Italy in 951 and married Adelaide, but he re turnedquickly to Germany to deal with a rebellion by Liudolf, duke of 
1 CONC Swabia,his son from an earlier marriage. Moreover, events in Germany f orced himinto a confrontation with the Magyars in 955 at the Lechfeld , where hisdecisive victory ended their attacks on German lands. (see also Index:Ottonian
