0 @N6000000001540958495@ NOTE Adele of Vermandois
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
1 CONT Adele of Vermandois (910-960) was a daughter of Herbert II of Vermandois with his first wife, Adela. She married Count Arnulf I of Flandersin 934 and had four children:
1 CONT
1 CONT Luitgard, married Wichmann, Count of Ghent
1 CONT Egbert, died 953
1 CONT Baldwin III of Flanders
1 CONT Elftrude, married Siegfried, Count of Guînes
1 CONT Through her descendants Matilda of Flanders and Henry I of England, she was an ancestor to the present-day British royal family.
