0 @N6000000003635705582@ NOTE [2975] COLVER31.TXT file
1 CONT
1 CONT WSHNGT.ASC file (Geo Washington Ahnentafel) # 4362574 = 918990 = 460354, also # 8725330 = 460354; Athelred "the Unready", places of b. & d.
