1 CONT Citations
1 CONT [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Family: A Complete Genealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 22. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Family.
1 CONT [S130] Wikipedia, online http;//www.wikipedia.org. Hereinafter cited as Wikipedia.
