1 CONC . ... Rhys ab Owain (died 1078) was a king of Deheubarth in southern Wales. ... Caradog ap Gruffydd (died 1081) was a prince of Gwent in south-east Wales who made repeated attempts to gain power over all of southern Wales by seizi
