1 CONT     * Annals of Tigernach
1 CONT
1 CONT Preceded by
1 CONT Máel Coluim mac Máil Brigti Mormaer of Moray
1 CONT 1029-1032 Succeeded by
1 CONT Mac Bethad mac Findláich
