0 @N6000000003051267844@ NOTE [Weis 147] Lay Abbott of Dunkeld.  "1045. A battle between the Scots themselves, where fell Crinan abbot of Duncaillen."
1 CONT
1 CONT [From Wikipedia: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cr%C3%ADn%C3%A1n_of_Dunkeld]
